OL,5,G1700 This Classical Life
OL,6,     FJess Gillam is joined by the
OL,7,     FScottish jazz pianist and composer
OL,8,     FFergus McCreadie for a listening
OL,9,     Fparty, featuring music by Brahms,
OL,10,     FSaariaho and Scott Walker.
OL,11,G1800 Opera on 3
OL,12,     FLisette Oropesa stars as Alcina
OL,13,     Fand Emily D'Angelo as the knight
OL,14,     FRuggiero in Handel's Alcina - a
OL,15,     Ftale of love, sorcery and betrayal
OL,16,     Fon a magical island.
OL,17,G2130 Music Planet
OL,18,     FLopa Kothari presents the best in
OL,19,     Ffolk and roots-based music from
OL,20,     Faround the world, including a live
OL,21,     Fsession from Belarusian-Polish
OL,22,     Fband Hajda Banda.
